    <briefdescription>
<para>Google Cloud Storage (GCS) Blob Backend. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Stores blobs in a GCS bucket using the google-cloud-cpp Storage SDK.</para>
<para>Authentication uses Application Default Credentials (ADC) via the GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS environment variable. The constructor fails-closed (marks the backend unavailable) when no valid credentials are present so that THEMIS_PRODUCTION_MODE safety guarantees are upheld.</para>
<para>Thread-Safety: All methods are thread-safe. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
